<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Value Tree — Mattel Montoi VSA 2026</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0D1B2A;
    --navy2: #152336;
    --navy3: #1E3151;
    --red: #C41E3A;
    --red-light: #E8304A;
    --gold: #E8A020;
    --cream: #F2EDE4;
    --green: #2A9D5C;
    --amber: #F4A024;
    --muted: #8BA3C0;
    --border: rgba(139,163,192,0.18);
    --card-bg: rgba(21,35,54,0.85);
    --font-display: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    --font-mono: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    --font-serif: 'Lora', serif;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* NOISE TEXTURE */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* HEADER */
  .header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 24px 40px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13,27,42,0.98) 0%, rgba(13,27,42,0.0) 100%);
  }

  .header-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .header-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .header-title span { color: var(--red); }

  .header-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .target-badge {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red) 0%, #8B0F26 100%);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(196,30,58,0.35);
  }
  .target-badge .lbl { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .target-badge .amt { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: #fff; line-height: 1; }

  .status-chips { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .chip {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
    padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    border: 1px solid;
  }
  .chip.ok { color: var(--green); border-color: rgba(42,157,92,0.35); background: rgba(42,157,92,0.08); }
  .chip.warn { color: var(--amber); border-color: rgba(244,160,36,0.35); background: rgba(244,160,36,0.08); }
  .chip.miss { color: var(--red); border-color: rgba(196,30,58,0.35); background: rgba(196,30,58,0.08); }
  .chip .dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* LAYOUT */
  .main {
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 100px);
  }

  /* TREE PANEL */
  .tree-panel {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 32px 20px 40px 40px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  /* DETAIL PANEL */
  .detail-panel {
    width: 340px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--navy2);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 28px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: calc(100vh - 100px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .detail-empty {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100%;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .detail-empty .icon { font-size: 36px; opacity: 0.4; }
  .detail-empty p { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; line-height: 1.6; }

  .detail-content { display: none; animation: fadeSlide 0.25s ease; }
  .detail-content.active { display: block; }

  @keyframes fadeSlide {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .detail-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .detail-tag.pilar1 { background: rgba(196,30,58,0.2); color: var(--red-light); border: 1px solid rgba(196,30,58,0.3); }
  .detail-tag.pilar2 { background: rgba(232,160,32,0.15); color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid rgba(232,160,32,0.3); }
  .detail-tag.pilar3 { background: rgba(42,157,92,0.15); color: var(--green); border: 1px solid rgba(42,157,92,0.3); }
  .detail-tag.pilar4 { background: rgba(139,163,192,0.12); color: #A8C4E0; border: 1px solid rgba(139,163,192,0.25); }

  .detail-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .detail-section { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .detail-section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .detail-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .detail-value.confirmed { color: var(--green); }
  .detail-value.validate { color: var(--amber); font-style: italic; }
  .detail-value.missing { color: var(--red-light); }

  .savings-box {
    background: var(--navy3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .savings-box .slabel {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .savings-box .svalue {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .savings-box .svalue.confirmed { color: var(--green); }
  .savings-box .svalue.validate { color: var(--amber); }
  .savings-box .svalue.missing { color: var(--red-light); }

  .source-tag {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    background: rgba(139,163,192,0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .action-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: rgba(242,237,228,0.8);
  }
  .action-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .action-icon { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 1px; }

  /* PROGRESS BAR */
  .progress-section {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    background: var(--navy2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .progress-header {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .progress-title { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .progress-pct { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; color: var(--amber); }

  .progress-bar-track {
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(139,163,192,0.12);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .progress-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green) 0%, var(--amber) 100%);
    width: 0%;
    transition: width 1s ease;
  }

  .progress-breakdown {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px;
  }
  .pb-item { display: flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center; }
  .pb-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* TREE NODES */
  .pillars-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .pilar-header {
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .pilar-header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--accent-color);
  }
  .pilar-header:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }

  .pilar-header .ph-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .pilar-header .ph-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .pilar-header .ph-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    color: rgba(242,237,228,0.5);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  /* LEVERS GRID */
  .levers-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .lever-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 11px 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .lever-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: var(--lever-color, var(--muted));
    opacity: 0.7;
    border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .lever-card:hover { 
    background: rgba(30,49,81,0.9);
    border-color: rgba(139,163,192,0.35);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }
  .lever-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .lever-card.selected {
    border-color: var(--lever-color, var(--muted));
    background: rgba(30,49,81,0.95);
  }

  .lever-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .lever-name {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.3;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .status-badge {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .lever-baseline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .lever-baseline .val { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 500; }
  .lever-savings {
    margin-top: 5px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .lever-savings.confirmed { color: var(--green); }
  .lever-savings.validate { color: var(--amber); }
  .lever-savings.missing { color: rgba(242,237,228,0.35); font-style: italic; }

  /* PILAR COLUMNS */
  .pilar-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(13,27,42,0.5);
  }

  /* ROOT NODE */
  .root-node {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196,30,58,0.15) 0%, rgba(21,35,54,0.8) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,30,58,0.25);
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .root-node::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--border), transparent);
  }
  .root-node .rn-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .root-node .rn-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .root-node .rn-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--red);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(196,30,58,0.4));
  }
  .root-node .rn-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* CONNECTOR LINES */
  .tree-connector {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    height: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .connector-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: 60%;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  /* COUNTER TICKER */
  .savings-tracker {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    z-index: 100;
    background: var(--navy2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    min-width: 200px;
  }
  .st-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .st-confirmed { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 11px; color: var(--green); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .st-validate { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 11px; color: var(--amber); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .st-bar { height: 4px; background: rgba(139,163,192,0.1); border-radius: 2px; margin-top: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
  .st-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), var(--amber)); transition: width 0.5s; }

  /* COLUMNS LABEL */
  .pilar-label {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: rgba(21,35,54,0.8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .lever-area { padding: 10px 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }

  /* TOOLTIP */
  .tooltip {
    position: fixed;
    background: var(--navy2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--cream);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 999;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
    max-width: 220px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SCROLLBAR */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(139,163,192,0.2); border-radius: 3px; }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.6; }
  }
  .pulsing { animation: pulse 2s infinite; }

  .workshop-date {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--amber);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="header">
  <div class="header-left">
    <span class="header-label">Mattel Montoi · General Escobedo, N.L. · VSA 2026</span>
    <div class="header-title">VALUE <span>TREE</span> — RUTA A LOS $500K</div>
    <span class="workshop-date">🗓 Workshop on-site: 11–15 Mayo 2026</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-right">
    <div class="status-chips">
      <div class="chip ok"><div class="dot"></div>✅ Dato confirmado</div>
      <div class="chip warn"><div class="dot"></div>⚠️ Dato parcial</div>
      <div class="chip miss"><div class="dot"></div>❌ A validar en planta</div>
    </div>
    <div class="target-badge">
      <div class="lbl">Objetivo USD</div>
      <div class="amt">$500K</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN -->
<div class="main">

  <!-- TREE PANEL -->
  <div class="tree-panel">

    <!-- PROGRESS -->
    <div class="progress-section">
      <div class="progress-header">
        <span class="progress-title">Cobertura de datos hacia el objetivo</span>
        <span class="progress-pct" id="pct-display">Calculando...</span>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-bar-track">
        <div class="progress-bar-fill" id="main-progress-bar"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="progress-breakdown">
        <div class="pb-item"><div class="pb-dot" style="background:var(--green)"></div><span style="color:var(--green)">Baseline confirmado: <strong>$318K</strong> (retrabajo)</span></div>
        <div class="pb-item"><div class="pb-dot" style="background:var(--amber)"></div><span style="color:var(--amber)">Parcial/cuantificable en workshop: ~$182K+ potencial</span></div>
        <div class="pb-item"><div class="pb-dot" style="background:rgba(139,163,192,0.3)"></div><span style="color:var(--muted)">Sin dato: requiere validación</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ROOT NODE -->
    <div class="root-node">
      <div class="rn-label">META SOSTENIBLE — VSA KAIZEN 2026</div>
      <div class="rn-title">AHORROS TOTALES</div>
      <div class="rn-amount">$500,000 USD</div>
      <div class="rn-sub">JKG84 Barbie Dream House · JHG61 Little People Nintendo Playset · ~25% del volumen de planta</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 PILLARS -->
    <div class="pillars-row">

      <!-- PILAR 1: CALIDAD -->
      <div class="pilar-column">
        <div class="pilar-header" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196,30,58,0.2) 0%, rgba(21,35,54,0.9) 100%); --accent-color: var(--red);">
          <div class="ph-num">PILAR 01</div>
          <div class="ph-title">CALIDAD<br>& RETRABAJO</div>
          <div class="ph-sub">CoQ · Rework · Scrap</div>
        </div>
        <div class="lever-area">

          <div class="lever-card" style="--lever-color: var(--red)" onclick="showDetail('L1')" id="card-L1">
            <div class="lever-top">
              <div class="lever-name">Reducción costo de retrabajo (Rework)</div>
              <div class="status-badge">⚠️</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lever-baseline">Baseline: <span class="val">$318K/año</span> confirmado</div>
            <div class="lever-savings validate">Ahorro potencial: dato a validar (% reducción)</div>
          </div>

          <div class="lever-card" style="--lever-color: var(--red)" onclick="showDetail('L2')" id="card-L2">
            <div class="lever-top">
              <div class="lever-name">Reducción de scrap por tipo de pieza</div>
              <div class="status-badge">❌</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lever-baseline">Baseline: <span class="val">No disponible</span></div>
            <div class="lever-savings missing">Dato a validar de ahorro</div>
          </div>

          <div class="lever-card" style="--lever-color: var(--red)" onclick="showDetail('L3')" id="card-L3">
            <div class="lever-top">
              <div class="lever-name">CoQ — Costo Total de Calidad (retrabajo + scrap + tiempo línea)</div>
              <div class="status-badge">❌</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lever-baseline">Baseline parcial: <span class="val">$318K</span> (sin desglose)</div>
            <div class="lever-savings missing">Dato a validar de ahorro</div>
          </div>

          <div class="lever-card" style="--lever-color: var(--red)" onclick="showDetail('L4')" id="card-L4">
            <div class="lever-top">
              <div class="lever-name">Calidad en ensamble (In-Process Control)</div>
              <div class="status-badge">⚠️</div>
